{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17830","headline":"同太常尉迟博士阙下待漏 · 杨巨源","name":"同太常尉迟博士阙下待漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈延阁抱丹墀，松色苔花颢露滋。\n爽气晓来青玉甃，薰风宿在翠花旗。\n方瞻御陌三条广，犹觉仙门一刻迟。\n此地含香从白首，冯唐何事怨明时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}